error[E0263]: braces group a range, not a string chain
 --> $DIR/chain-braces.nra:3:54
  |
3 | let braced = func(a: string, b: string) -> string => {a .. b};
  |                                                      ^^^^^^^^ the first operand is a string
  |
  = help: write the chain without braces, or parenthesize it: '(a .. b)'

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0263`.
